@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@lockedItemId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 从已保存搭配中选择可用且穿着次数较少的搭配
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "limit": 3
}

### 按场景筛选并锁定已有单品
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "occasion": "commute",
  "locked_item_ids": ["{{lockedItemId}}"],
  "limit": 3
}
